# Accessibility (UI)

- Icon-only controls need `aria-label`. Use real `<button>` / `<a>` / `<NavLink>`, not clickable `div`s.
- Keep skip links and named `<nav>`. Form inputs need visible labels.
- Do not convey state by color alone (include text or `aria-live` for errors).
- Keyboard: new interactive elements must be reachable without a pointer.
- Tester: add at least one `a11y` row in `qa-test-cases.md` when the spec has UI.
